Package: spatconnect
Type: Package
Title: Global and Local Indicators of Spatial Connectivity for Areal Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alvaro", "Briz-Redon", email = "alvaro.briz@uv.es", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marco", "Ruiz-Valderrama", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements graph-based global and local indicators of spatial
    connectivity for scalar areal data. The methodology uses Betti-0 curves of
    reference-centered superlevel and sublevel analyses, a component-specific
    activation-merging decomposition, global random-relabeling inference, and
    conditional local random-relabeling inference. The integrated merging
    contribution quantifies the cumulative participation of each area in
    component fusions across thresholds.
